After some time it's getting dark again. It seems you'll have to survive another night in the jungle. Suddenly, Snoopy starts to bark. You lift your eyes and see Beobras, Conan's father! He is girded by an ammunition belt and holds a shotgun in his hands.
"Henry! Henry! They're here, everyone!"
Old hunter drops the shotgun on the ground, and runs towards you. You run to meet him. Your parents and a large group of men appear from behind the trees. 
"Well, Henry, I will give you a proper spanking, when we get back!" father shakes his fist at you, but smiles and tears run down his cheeks. And you feel great tiredness and relief at the same time. You survived the night in the jungle, coped with other dangers, overcame the savages and rescued your Snoopy. Now you can return home. Return as the winners! 